---
import { docsHref } from '../navigation.mjs';
import AgentWorkflow from './AgentWorkflow.astro';
---
<div class="home-hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="_top">Versioned files.<br /><span>For your applications.</span></h1>
    <p>Give reports, documents, and workspaces their own repository. Publish changes through REST or Git, retrieve an exact version, and give workers access to just the work they need.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary-link" href={docsHref('getting-started')}>Build your first repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={docsHref('core/concepts')}>Understand the model <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <AgentWorkflow />
</div>
